  "name": "release-and-publish",
  "description": "Ship a release end-to-end across every registry the project targets (npm, MCP Registry, GitHub Releases for `.mcpb` bundles, GHCR). Runs the final verification gate, fast-forwards `main` when the release rode a release PR, creates the annotated tag on the commit `main` now points at, pushes commits and tags, then publishes to each applicable destination. Assumes git wrapup (version bumps, changelog, commit stack — and in release PR mode, the pushed branch and open PR) is already complete — this skill is the post-wrapup merge + tag + publish workflow. Retries transient network failures on publish steps; halts with a partial-state report when retries are exhausted or the failure is terminal.",
